Package: autoreportr
Type: Package
Title: AutoReportR: Automatic Statistical Reporting with AI Interpretations
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-06-08
Author: Stalec Alinkpesso
Maintainer: Stalec Alinkpesso <stalecalinkpesso9@gmail.com>
Description: AutoReportR v2.0 generates professional HTML statistical reports 
    with automatic descriptive statistics and AI-powered interpretations. 
    The package analyzes numeric and categorical variables, detects missing 
    values, and produces interactive, responsive reports. Key features include:
    automatic variable typing, univariate statistics (mean, median, sd, 
    quartiles, frequencies), missing data analysis, and intelligent 
    interpretations via Groq API (Llama 3.3-70B).
License: MIT
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    readxl
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3